                          "Citation": "Marzani B, Balage M, Vénien A, Astruc T, Papet I, Dardevet D, Mosoni L. Antioxidant Supplementation Restores Defective Leucine Stimulation of Protein Synthesis in Skeletal Muscle from Old Rats. The Journal of Nutrition. 2008 Nov;138(11):2205–11. doi: 10.3945/jn.108.094029.",
